OL,3,GNEWSAAncient bones found under patio to
OL,4,Abe laid to rest
OL,5,
OL,6,FAncient bones dug up by a couple during
OL,7,Frenovations are finally being laid to
OL,8,Frest in a churchyard in Kent.
OL,10,FRoss and Clare Sledger, who own a pub
OL,11,Fin Wye near Ashford, made the discovery
OL,12,Fin 2019 while digging up their patio
OL,13,Fand quickly called the police.
OL,15,FThe bones were later estimated to be
OL,16,Fabout 1,000 years old.
OL,18,FThe remains will be buried in the
OL,19,Fgraveyard of St Gregory and St Martin
OL,20,FChurch in the village on Wednesday.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
